#    under the dispatched workspace's tree only. A's state at
#    A's path is not touched when B dispatches.
#
# Log file (`first-run.log`) stays at `<pos_root>/first-run.log`
# — host-global — unchanged. Only the state artefact moves.
# The `pos_root` CLI arg on dispatcher and helper is preserved
# for log writes; a new `--workspace-root`-equivalent is not
# added because the helper already receives `--pos-v2-root`
# and the dispatcher knows `pos_v2_root` at its entry.
#
# Legacy `~/.pos/first-run.state` is left in place. The new
# logic reads workspace-local paths; the legacy file is
# simply never consulted. No migration code ships — per plan
