# Amendment #64 — D-migration D.3 — pos-sync becomes git fetch + git merge --ff-only against framework/

2026-04-26. Third of the five D-migration amendments. D.1 (sealed
at 570092a, Amendment #61) restructured canonical pos-v2's
`framework/<component>/` layout. D.1.5 (sealed at 21e27f2,
Amendment #62) added rename-aware seal logic to pos-amend. D.2
(sealed at 7ef1e23, Amendment #63) established the
`<workspace>/workspace/` directory + cut over every reader of
workspace-state paths. D.3 retires the bespoke
resolve→stage→apply pipeline in workspace-sync in favour of
`git fetch + git merge --ff-only` against `<workspace>/framework/`.
The LLM-resolver primitives (merge_resolver.py + _resolver_client.py
with --strict-mcp-config) are preserved as the rare-conflict
fallback the new CLI invokes only when the merge produces
unresolved conflicts.

This is the keystone semantic change of D: it eliminates the
bug class that triggered the migration (workspace-state lost or
overwritten by α / α-hotfix-2's bespoke pipeline). Post-D.3,
workspace-state under `<workspace>/workspace/` is structurally
unreachable from pos-sync — the merge operates exclusively
inside `<workspace>/framework/`. HC#6 structural promise
delivered.

